{"seq":1,"slug":"symbolic-midi","title":"MIDI 与符号音乐表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/music-representation/symbolic-midi","wordCount":1260,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"midi-与符号音乐表示\">MIDI 与符号音乐表示</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>符号音乐表示把音乐抽象为一串离散事件，理解它需要抓住四个要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>事件是基本单位</strong>：一个音符被编码为音高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、起止时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>on</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>off</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{on}}, t_{\\text{off}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">on</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">off</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与力度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>，丢掉了声学细节，保住了结构本质。</li>\n<li><strong>MIDI 是最通用的载体</strong>：以 <code>Status Byte + Data Byte</code> 的事件流表达 Note On/Off、CC、Pitch Bend 等语义。</li>\n<li><strong>Piano Roll 提供矩阵视图</strong>：把事件展成时间×音高的二维矩阵，便于 CNN/RNN 直接消费，量化分辨率决定精度与规模。</li>\n<li><strong>优势与局限同在</strong>：紧凑、可编辑、结构可读，但无法表达音色、微表情与录音环境。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这四个要点共同回答了&quot;符号表示是什么、用什么承载、如何喂给模型、什么时候不该用它&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"符号表示的本质与历史\">符号表示的本质与历史</h2><p>符号音乐表示（Symbolic Music Representation）将音乐抽象为离散事件的序列——音高、时值、力度等参数的组合。这种表示方式对应人类的乐谱传统，丢弃了声学细节但保留了音乐的结构本质：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Note Event</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>on</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>off</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>127</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>127</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Note Event} = (p, t_{\\text{on}}, t_{\\text{off}}, v) \\quad p \\in [0,127], \\; v \\in [0,127]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Note Event</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">on</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">off</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">127</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">127</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是 MIDI 音高编号，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>on</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{on}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">on</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>off</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{off}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">off</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是起止时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 是力度值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表示格式</th>\n<th>诞生年代</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MIDI Standard File</td>\n<td>1983</td>\n<td>事件驱动、紧凑</td>\n<td>通用交换/硬件控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MusicXML</td>\n<td>2004</td>\n<td>乐谱完整、人类可读</td>\n<td>排版/分析/教育</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ABC Notation</td>\n<td>1997</td>\n<td>极简文本、易输入</td>\n<td>民乐/快速记谱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kern / Humdrum</td>\n<td>1993</td>\n<td>学术分析导向</td>\n<td>计算音乐学研究</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Piano Roll Matrix</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>二维矩阵（时间×音高）</td>\n<td>CNN/RNN 输入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 乐谱层[&quot;乐谱级表示&quot;]&#10;        MX[&quot;MusicXML&lt;br/&gt;完整乐谱信息&quot;]&#10;        LY[&quot;LilyPond&lt;br/&gt;排版导向&quot;]&#10;        AB[&quot;ABC&lt;br/&gt;文本极简&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 事件层[&quot;事件级表示&quot;]&#10;        MI[&quot;MIDI Events&lt;br/&gt;Note On/Off + CC&quot;]&#10;        PR[&quot;Piano Roll&lt;br/&gt;时间×音高矩阵&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 模型层[&quot;模型输入&quot;]&#10;        TK[&quot;Token序列&lt;br/&gt;离散词表&quot;]&#10;        MT[&quot;矩阵张量&lt;br/&gt;2D/3D&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    MX --&gt; MI&#10;    LY --&gt; MI&#10;    AB --&gt; MI&#10;    MI --&gt; TK&#10;    MI --&gt; PR&#10;    PR --&gt; MT\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 乐谱层[\"乐谱级表示\"]\n        MX[\"MusicXML&lt;br/&gt;完整乐谱信息\"]\n        LY[\"LilyPond&lt;br/&gt;排版导向\"]\n        AB[\"ABC&lt;br/&gt;文本极简\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 事件层[\"事件级表示\"]\n        MI[\"MIDI Events&lt;br/&gt;Note On/Off + CC\"]\n        PR[\"Piano Roll&lt;br/&gt;时间×音高矩阵\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 模型层[\"模型输入\"]\n        TK[\"Token序列&lt;br/&gt;离散词表\"]\n        MT[\"矩阵张量&lt;br/&gt;2D/3D\"]\n    end\n    MX --&gt; MI\n    LY --&gt; MI\n    AB --&gt; MI\n    MI --&gt; TK\n    MI --&gt; PR\n    PR --&gt; MT</pre><h2 id=\"midi-协议与事件编码\">MIDI 协议与事件编码</h2><p>MIDI（Musical Instrument Digital Interface）是最广泛使用的符号音乐协议。其核心是事件流（Event Stream）——每个事件携带消息类型和参数数据：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MIDI Message</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Status Byte</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Data Byte 1</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Data Byte 2</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MIDI Message} = [\\text{Status Byte}] + [\\text{Data Byte 1}] + [\\text{Data Byte 2}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MIDI Message</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Status Byte</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Data Byte 1</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Data Byte 2</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Status Byte 的高 4 位指定消息类型（Note On = 0x9, Note Off = 0x8, CC = 0xB），低 4 位指定通道（0–15）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>消息类型</th>\n<th>数据字节</th>\n<th>分辨率</th>\n<th>AI 生成中的意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Note On</td>\n<td>音高 + 力度</td>\n<td>128×128</td>\n<td>核心音符生成目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Note Off</td>\n<td>音高 + 力度</td>\n<td>128×128</td>\n<td>时值定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Control Change</td>\n<td>CC号 + 值</td>\n<td>128×128</td>\n<td>表情/效果控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pitch Bend</td>\n<td>LSB + MSB</td>\n<td>16384级</td>\n<td>微分音/滑音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Program Change</td>\n<td>音色号</td>\n<td>128</td>\n<td>乐器选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tempo (Meta)</td>\n<td>BPM值</td>\n<td>连续</td>\n<td>速度映射</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph MIDI文件[&quot;MIDI文件结构&quot;]&#10;        H[&quot;Header Chunk&lt;br/&gt;格式/轨道数/分辨率&quot;]&#10;        T1[&quot;Track 1&lt;br/&gt;Tempo/Time Sig&quot;]&#10;        T2[&quot;Track 2&lt;br/&gt;Piano Events&quot;]&#10;        T3[&quot;Track 3&lt;br/&gt;Bass Events&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 事件流[&quot;Track内事件流&quot;]&#10;        DT[&quot;Delta Time&lt;br/&gt;距上一事件的Tick数&quot;]&#10;        EV[&quot;Event&lt;br/&gt;Note On/Off/CC&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 解析[&quot;解析为训练数据&quot;]&#10;        ABS[&quot;绝对时间转换&lt;br/&gt;Tick→秒&quot;]&#10;        SEG[&quot;分段切片&lt;br/&gt;按小节/固定长度&quot;]&#10;        ENC[&quot;编码为Token&lt;br/&gt;词表映射&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    H --&gt; T1&#10;    H --&gt; T2&#10;    H --&gt; T3&#10;    T2 --&gt; DT&#10;    DT --&gt; EV&#10;    EV --&gt; ABS --&gt; SEG --&gt; ENC\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph MIDI文件[\"MIDI文件结构\"]\n        H[\"Header Chunk&lt;br/&gt;格式/轨道数/分辨率\"]\n        T1[\"Track 1&lt;br/&gt;Tempo/Time Sig\"]\n        T2[\"Track 2&lt;br/&gt;Piano Events\"]\n        T3[\"Track 3&lt;br/&gt;Bass Events\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 事件流[\"Track内事件流\"]\n        DT[\"Delta Time&lt;br/&gt;距上一事件的Tick数\"]\n        EV[\"Event&lt;br/&gt;Note On/Off/CC\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 解析[\"解析为训练数据\"]\n        ABS[\"绝对时间转换&lt;br/&gt;Tick→秒\"]\n        SEG[\"分段切片&lt;br/&gt;按小节/固定长度\"]\n        ENC[\"编码为Token&lt;br/&gt;词表映射\"]\n    end\n    H --&gt; T1\n    H --&gt; T2\n    H --&gt; T3\n    T2 --&gt; DT\n    DT --&gt; EV\n    EV --&gt; ABS --&gt; SEG --&gt; ENC</pre><h2 id=\"piano-roll-矩阵表示\">Piano Roll 矩阵表示</h2><p>Piano Roll 是将 MIDI 数据转换为二维矩阵的直观表示：横轴为时间步，纵轴为音高，矩阵值表示该时间点该音高是否发声及力度大小：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>127</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if note </mtext><mi>p</mi><mtext> is on at time </mtext><mi>t</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>otherwise</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M[t, p] = \\begin{cases} v/127 &amp; \\text{if note } p \\text{ is on at time } t \\\\ 0 &amp; \\text{otherwise} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord\">/127</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if note </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> is on at time </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">otherwise</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>时间步的分辨率（Quantization）是关键设计决策——16 分音符（每拍 4 步）是常见选择，平衡精度和矩阵大小。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分辨率设置</th>\n<th>每拍步数</th>\n<th>每小节列数</th>\n<th>优劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>8分音符</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>丢失快速装饰音/矩阵小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16分音符</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>常用平衡点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>32分音符</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>保留细节/矩阵翻倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tick级</td>\n<td>24–480</td>\n<td>96–1920</td>\n<td>最高精度/计算昂贵</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>多轨 Piano Roll 扩展为三维张量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M \\in \\mathbb{R}^{T \\times P \\times C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（时间×音高×通道），或将多轨叠加为多通道图像输入 CNN。</p>\n<h2 id=\"符号表示的优势与局限\">符号表示的优势与局限</h2><p>符号表示在 AI 音乐生成中既有独特优势也有固有局限。理解这些特性有助于选择合适的表示方法：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Information Loss</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Audio</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Symbolic</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mtext>音色</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>微表情</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>录音环境</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Information Loss} = H(\\text{Audio}) - H(\\text{Symbolic}) \\approx \\text{音色} + \\text{微表情} + \\text{录音环境}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Information Loss</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Audio</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Symbolic</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">音色</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">微表情</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">录音环境</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据效率</td>\n<td>极紧凑（KB级 vs 音频MB级）</td>\n<td>无法表达音色/录音质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构信息</td>\n<td>和声/旋律/节奏直接可读</td>\n<td>缺失演奏微细节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可编辑性</td>\n<td>生成后可精确修改任何音符</td>\n<td>修改不直接听到效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练数据</td>\n<td>互联网上大量 MIDI 可获取</td>\n<td>质量参差/标注不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多模态</td>\n<td>可与乐谱渲染关联</td>\n<td>需要额外音色合成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评估</td>\n<td>可计算乐理指标</td>\n<td>音乐感知不等于乐理正确</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 输入[&quot;音乐源&quot;]&#10;        P[&quot;真实演奏&lt;br/&gt;充满微表情&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 符号化[&quot;符号化过程&quot;]&#10;        Q[&quot;量化&lt;br/&gt;对齐到网格&quot;]&#10;        D[&quot;离散化&lt;br/&gt;连续→离散&quot;]&#10;        L[&quot;丢失&lt;br/&gt;音色/空间/表情&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 表示[&quot;符号表示&quot;]&#10;        S[&quot;离散序列&lt;br/&gt;结构清晰&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 重建[&quot;音频重建&quot;]&#10;        SY[&quot;合成器渲染&lt;br/&gt;选择音色&quot;]&#10;        EX[&quot;表情恢复&lt;br/&gt;力度/timing微调&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    P --&gt; Q --&gt; D --&gt; S&#10;    D --&gt; L&#10;    S --&gt; SY --&gt; EX\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 输入[\"音乐源\"]\n        P[\"真实演奏&lt;br/&gt;充满微表情\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 符号化[\"符号化过程\"]\n        Q[\"量化&lt;br/&gt;对齐到网格\"]\n        D[\"离散化&lt;br/&gt;连续→离散\"]\n        L[\"丢失&lt;br/&gt;音色/空间/表情\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 表示[\"符号表示\"]\n        S[\"离散序列&lt;br/&gt;结构清晰\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 重建[\"音频重建\"]\n        SY[\"合成器渲染&lt;br/&gt;选择音色\"]\n        EX[\"表情恢复&lt;br/&gt;力度/timing微调\"]\n    end\n    P --&gt; Q --&gt; D --&gt; S\n    D --&gt; L\n    S --&gt; SY --&gt; EX</pre><p>符号表示最适合以下 AI 任务：旋律生成、和声编排、乐曲结构规划、风格分析、音乐教育。当任务涉及音色设计、录音美学或真实感演绎时，需要切换到音频表示或混合方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>符号音乐把音乐编码为离散事件序列，对应人类乐谱传统。</li>\n<li>MIDI 用 Status/Data 事件流表达音高、力度与控制变化，是通用交换格式。</li>\n<li>Piano Roll 把事件转为二维矩阵，量化分辨率是精度与规模的权衡。</li>\n<li>符号表示数据效率高、可精确编辑，但丢失音色、空间与表情信息。</li>\n<li>它适合结构与旋律类任务，音色与真实感任务则需转向音频表示。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"MIDI 与符号音乐表示","id":"midi-与符号音乐表示"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"符号表示的本质与历史","id":"符号表示的本质与历史"},{"level":2,"text":"MIDI 协议与事件编码","id":"midi-协议与事件编码"},{"level":2,"text":"Piano Roll 矩阵表示","id":"piano-roll-矩阵表示"},{"level":2,"text":"符号表示的优势与局限","id":"符号表示的优势与局限"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"音频频谱表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/music-representation/audio-spectrogram"}}